yangest
Copyright 2026 Magnus Thoäng

This product was developed independently and does not contain any source
code derived from yanger (https://github.com/mbj4668/yanger).

yangest is designed to be a compatible companion to yanger — it accepts the
same YANG input, supports the same output formats, and uses the same extension
and deviation mechanisms — but is a from-scratch Rust implementation.

